      "side": 1,
      "message": "We do some binding remapping before invoking the MSL backend, which causes duplicates. This isn\u0027t a bug - the MSL backend just uses the `kAllowDuplicateBindings` capability on all of its transforms to ignore the validation error. But `PrepareImmediateData` does not set that capability when validating yet, which is why you now see that error. I think it\u0027s fine to just add that capability to `PrepareImmediateData` too.",
